values ('tg-videography-meet-up-icon-industries-2026-10-14', 'Videography Meet-Up @ ICON Industries', 'Every Wednesday, videographers, editors, and motion creatives come together at Icon Industries to connect, collaborate, and grow. Whether you''re running a solo operation, building a studio, or freelancing between gigs, this is a space built for us, a place to strengthen the local video community and help each other move forward.

