values ('tg-vibe-check-2026-10-18', 'Vibe Check 🌀', '** Conscious Leaders Collaborating **

A monthly gathering for conscious leaders to connect, reflect, and collaborate.

This is a space for people who’ve done the inner work, and are now focused on living, building, and creating from that place.

Location: Encinitas

Flow of the afternoon
• Arrival (3–3:30p)
• Opening + agreements
• Somatic warm-up (Sound & Shape)
• Prompt-based round robin
• Small group breakouts
• Activation (breathwork / soundbath)
• Final vibe check
• Socializing / dancing
• Doors close at 6:30p

⸻

July Prompt:
"What''s your ask of the community, and what would that do for you”

⸻

Catered food will be provided.', 'c1d40f58-318b-4c7b-a331-21788d632fc9', (select region_id from _tg), 'public', timestamptz '2026-10-18 15:00+00', timestamptz '2026-10-18 18:00+00', 'America/Los_Angeles', 'Encinitas private residence', 'public', 'published', now(), 'rsvp', 'social', 'social', 'in_person', 'manual', 'db42cbea-3229-9813-e691-cb0e05272808', 'db42cbea-3229-9813-e691-cb0e05272808', 'monthly', 'FREQ=MONTHLY;BYMONTHDAY=18', false)
