values ('tg-pitchfest-presentations-party-2026-10-21', 'PitchFest Presentations & Party', 'Join us for The Group Coastal’s 2nd Annual Pitchfest Presentations & Party!

Pitchfest supports entrepreneurs on their journey from concept to capital, turning big ideas into real opportunities. Participants will take the stage to present their businesses, products, and services to The Group community.

Come enjoy an inspiring evening of entrepreneurial ideas, meaningful connections, community, and celebration.

