values ('tg-full-moon-hike-sanguine-moon-2026-10-26', 'Full Moon Hike: Sanguine Moon', 'Join us Monday, October 26, for a Spooky & Fun Full Moon Hike at Penasquitos Waterfall Trail.

The canyon has stories. And on the night of the full moon, we''re going in.

Join Camp Bum + The Group Coastal for our most haunted hike of the year as we take Los Peñasquitos Canyon after dark - one of San Diego''s oldest and most storied wild spaces, with legends that go back centuries. We''ll hike by moonlight, share the local lore and ghost stories that haunt these trails, and let the canyon do the rest.

Costumes are encouraged. Treats will be had. Spooky stories are welcome so bring your best ones.', 'c1d40f58-318b-4c7b-a331-21788d632fc9', (select region_id from _tg), 'public', timestamptz '2026-10-26 18:30+00', timestamptz '2026-10-26 21:00+00', 'America/Los_Angeles', 'Peñasquitos Creek Park Trailhead', 'public', 'published', now(), 'rsvp', 'social', 'social', 'in_person', 'manual', 'db42cbea-3229-9813-e691-cb0e05272808', 'db42cbea-3229-9813-e691-cb0e05272808', 'none', null, false)
