values ('tg-playful-public-speaking-2026-10-27', 'Playful Public Speaking', 'Playful Public Speaking: No Script? No Problem!
🗓 Tuesday, October 27, 4–6pm
📍 Tailored Space, Oceanside

If you''ve been putting off your 5-minute presentation because of nerves (or pure, sweaty-palmed terror), this workshop is for you.

If you''re an entrepreneur sharpening your voice and how you show up in a room, this workshop is for you.

And if you just want to laugh, play, and get out of your head for an afternoon, this is definitely for you.

No scripts, no pressure, no panic attacks. Just low-stakes games that build real confidence.

Spots are limited. Grab yours here: https://luma.com/ukte82io

Questions? Reply here or message me directly. I''d love to see you there!', 'c1d40f58-318b-4c7b-a331-21788d632fc9', (select region_id from _tg), 'public', timestamptz '2026-10-27 16:00+00', timestamptz '2026-10-27 18:00+00', 'America/Los_Angeles', 'Tailored Space, 3605 Ocean Ranch Blvd Ste 202 Oceanside, CA 92056', 'public', 'published', now(), 'rsvp', 'learning', null, 'in_person', 'manual', 'db42cbea-3229-9813-e691-cb0e05272808', 'ffad975a-6187-dfe4-9def-4cc891dda8da', 'none', null, false)
