values ('tg-woman-within-circle-2026-10-31', 'Woman Within Circle', 'You’re warmly invited to join our Women Within Circle, tomorrow a confidential, supportive space where women gather to connect authentically, be witnessed, and support one another through life’s joys and challenges.
