values ('tg-swamis-beach-gathering-in-the-grass-2026-11-08', 'Swami’s Beach Gathering in the Grass', 'Join us tomorrow
Swami’s Beach Gathering 💃🕺
Sundays at 2:00 PM and on

We are reviving a beautiful community gathering every Sunday at 2:00 PM at Swami’s Beach Park on the park above the cliffs, next to the Self-Realization Fellowship Meditation Gardens (Yogananda temple).🧘

This is a space to come together in connection, presence, and joy outdoors with ocean views, in the natural rhythm of community.👩‍❤️‍💋‍👨

* Drumming and rhythm circle
* Free dance and movement
* Hula hooping and playful expression
* Slackline (slacker) between the trees
* Sharing food or eating together on the grass
* Sitting in circle, connecting and sharing
* Resting, laughing, and simply being together
Chi Nei', 'c1d40f58-318b-4c7b-a331-21788d632fc9', (select region_id from _tg), 'public', timestamptz '2026-11-08 14:00+00', timestamptz '2026-11-08 16:00+00', 'America/Los_Angeles', '1298 S Coast Hwy 101 Encinitas, CA 9202', 'public', 'published', now(), 'rsvp', 'social', 'social', 'in_person', 'manual', 'db42cbea-3229-9813-e691-cb0e05272808', 'db42cbea-3229-9813-e691-cb0e05272808', 'none', null, false)
