values ('tg-wild-worthy-womens-collective-2026-11-09', 'Wild & Worthy Women''s Collective', 'Wild & Worthy Women’s Circle is officially here!
One of my deepest joy’s is to bring women together for REAL connection & I’m so excited to bring it to my new home.

Let’s join together for honest conversation about the things we actually care about.
Intimacy, purpose, love, relationships, sensuality PLUS all the taboo or tender topics like sex, aging, money, menopause- but that we deeply crave connection around.

For women who are ready to stop dimming their light and start showing up fully, wild, worthy, and unapologetically themselves.

Not to compete.
Not to perform.
Not to pretend we have it all together.

But to exhale…
to laugh…
to speak truth…
to remember who we are.', 'c1d40f58-318b-4c7b-a331-21788d632fc9', (select region_id from _tg), 'public', timestamptz '2026-11-09 18:30+00', timestamptz '2026-11-09 20:30+00', 'America/Los_Angeles', 'The LightHouse, Cardiff, CA- exact location given upon registration', 'public', 'published', now(), 'rsvp', 'gathering', 'grounding', 'in_person', 'manual', 'db42cbea-3229-9813-e691-cb0e05272808', 'db42cbea-3229-9813-e691-cb0e05272808', 'none', null, false)
