values ('tg-breath-connect-expand-2026-11-12', 'Breath Connect Expand', 'Have you also been feeling the call to connect more deeply with yourself, expand your nervous system’s capacity, and do it in community? ☀️

This experience is a unique blend of breathwork, guided visualization, craniosacral therapy, nature, and authentic human connection. 🌳🫂

I created this experience because reconnecting to my emotions and nervous system is what helped me heal from debilitating social anxiety and panic attacks and create a life I genuinely love. ❤️

One of the biggest things I learned along the way is that healing doesn’t have to happen alone. There is something deeply powerful about connecting with others while doing our inner work.', 'c1d40f58-318b-4c7b-a331-21788d632fc9', (select region_id from _tg), 'public', timestamptz '2026-11-12 18:30+00', timestamptz '2026-11-12 19:30+00', 'America/Los_Angeles', 'Encinitas Viewpoint Park', 'public', 'published', now(), 'rsvp', 'learning', null, 'in_person', 'manual', 'db42cbea-3229-9813-e691-cb0e05272808', 'db42cbea-3229-9813-e691-cb0e05272808', 'none', null, false)
