values ('tg-1212-divine-mother-journey-2026-12-12', '12/12 Divine Mother Journey', 'Dear Sisters,

You''re invited to join me for a sacred overnight medicine journey on Saturday, December 12, Sunday, December 13, 2026, honoring Our Lady of Guadalupe and the Divine Mother.

December 12 is the Feast of Our Lady of Guadalupe. Her image holds a special place in the hearts of many as a symbol of maternal love, compassion, protection, and hope.

For those who work with the symbolism of numbers, 12/12 also offers a potent portal for reflection and renewal. As the year draws to a close, we will gather to listen for what is ready to be released, what longs to be nurtured, and what is asking to be born through us.', 'c1d40f58-318b-4c7b-a331-21788d632fc9', (select region_id from _tg), 'public', timestamptz '2026-12-12 15:00+00', timestamptz '2026-12-12 16:30+00', 'America/Los_Angeles', 'Northern San Diego County - Provided upon registration', 'public', 'published', now(), 'rsvp', 'gathering', 'grounding', 'in_person', 'manual', 'db42cbea-3229-9813-e691-cb0e05272808', 'db42cbea-3229-9813-e691-cb0e05272808', 'none', null, false)
