values ('tg-the-coaches-club-2027-01-07', 'The Coaches Club', 'Join us at THE COACHES CLUB this week!

TUESDAY, JULY 7th at 9:30 am via ZOOM

The COACHES CLUB is designed for coaches and anyone who gets paid for their expertise, including consultants, practitioners, trainers, speakers, authors, advisors, and service-based entrepreneurs.

What could be more important than working ON your business while you connect, collaborate, and build community with other growth-minded professionals?
Whether you''re a coach, consultant, practitioner, or service-based entrepreneur, you don''t have to build your business alone.

Choose yourself. Choose your business. Choose community.

Send me a DM if you want more information or to claim your free spot.

